                "default": "Translate the following text into ${targetLang} accurately and fluently.\nOnly output the translated result without any additional explanation.{{#if hasProtectedMarkers}} Keep each <CTP...> marker unchanged.{{/if}}\n{{#if isBatch}}The input contains ${itemCount} items in order. Separate their translations with ${separator} on its own line.\n{{/if}}"
              },
